<title>FRANCE: GEC Alsthom in 5.4 bln ffr Danish train order.</title>
<headline>GEC Alsthom in 5.4 bln ffr Danish train order.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>GEC-Alsthom NV  said on Tuesday that a consortium it heads has won a 5.4 billion franc order from Denmark's railway for 112 train sets.</p>
<p>The order was won by GEC Alsthom's Linke-Hofmann-Busch (LHB) and Siemens AG and was awarded by Danish state railways DSB, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>GEC Alsthom is a joint venture of GEC and Alcatel Alsthom.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
